sequenceDiagram
    actor Director as Project Director
    participant View as Razor View
    participant Controller as ProjectsController
    participant Service as ProjectService
    participant Db as ApplicationDbContext
    participant Sql as SQL Server
    Director->>View: Nhập thông tin dự án
    View->>Controller: POST Create
    Controller->>Service: Validate and save
    Service->>Db: Kiểm tra mã dự án
    Db->>Sql: Query/Save Project
    Sql-->>Db: Kết quả
    Db-->>Service: Project saved
    Service-->>Controller: Success/Error
    Controller-->>View: Redirect hoặc validation
